    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A UCLA business graduate lured by money and status, Peter Kwan became first the ghoul, then the Blood Bound childe of Jochen Van Nuys, rising quickly in the Ventrue's entourage. Sent into Chinatown to scout the Cathayan threat, Kwan was captured by Chan Te's Hollow City wu and subjected to months of torture and spiritual conditioning until he willingly pledged himself to Yama King Mikaboshi. He returned to Van Nuys with a cover story of having escaped Kuei-jin captors, and now serves as a mole feeding Camarilla intelligence to the Yama Kings' agents.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Kwan defers publicly to Van Nuys while secretly despising him, playing Kindred and Kuei-jin against one another and awaiting the day he can openly claim a portion of the Wicked City in Mikaboshi's name.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Jochen Van Nuys (unaware of Kwan's betrayal). Secret allegiance: akuma of Yama King Mikaboshi, agent of Chan Te's Hollow City wu. Disciplines (as printed): Auspex 2, Celerity 1, Dominate 2, Fortitude 2, Presence 2.",
